                        "review": "I get that it is a puzzle game, but...  I missed the prompt about how to replay tapes because my cat came over to demand treats.  I don't know how to do it without restarting the game because I see nothing that easily gives me the reminder that I need.  Also trying to rotate the rig we start on so I can go in doors works terribly, most of the attempts didn't even complete the move.  *sigh* I don't like this one at all.",
